  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/DotNetVibeCoderz/Vibe_Database/tree/main/FAISS.Net",
  "published": "2026-10-28T07:35:25.14Z",
  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: filtered search (IDSelector, SearchParameters) inside the scan of every index; IndexRefine; searches while one writer adds, SynchronizedIndex, crash-safe PersistentIndex; HNSW over SQ and PQ storage, NSG, IMI, HNSW coarse quantizer with sink repair (FAISS #5705), RQ and LSQ additive quantizers, binary HNSW, sparse IndexSparseFlat; blocked GEMM flat search, precomputed IVFPQ tables, SIMD fp16 and 4-bit decode, parallel shard search, reducing OPQ, mini-batch k-means. Fixes: OPQ indexes failed to reload; seeded training was not reproducible. Benchmarked against FAISS 1.15.1: recall within two points everywhere.",
